        label: "Turbocharger & Integrated Exhaust Manifold",
        x: 0.01,
        y: 0.09,
        z: 0.47,
        critical: true,
        details: "EXHAUST & BOOST FAULT: The integrated exhaust manifold and turbocharger layout requires precise thermal management; wastegate linkage play can trigger underboost codes."
